cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the paper."
title: "Analysis code for: Predicting neurological outcome for comatose cardiac arrest patients from early EEG reactivity data by use of machine learning"
abstract: >-
  Leave-one-out cross-validated XGBoost analysis of EEG reactivity features
  recorded within 24 hours of cardiac arrest, predicting Cerebral Performance
  Category at 6 months as a four-class outcome and dichotomised into good
  (CPC 1-3) versus poor (CPC 4-5) outcome.
